    <briefdescription>
<para>Static shader program builder — compiles, links, and binds uniform setters. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Pure static utility. No instance state.</para>
<para><ref refid="structshader_1_1_compiler_1a1fc06cd95371860a447a28fcf9000d35" kindref="member">build()</ref> compiles and links a shader program from vertex + fragment sources. <ref refid="structshader_1_1_compiler_1a504ae4bf80f9c504b7b224fad2caf8ec" kindref="member">buildUniformSetter()</ref> discovers active uniforms from a linked program and returns a single std::function that sets all of them in one call.</para>
<para>Thread contract: ALL methods GL THREAD only. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
